 "purpose": "Developer-only test field («Тест 07») for the altar mechanic (candidate for FIELD-007 «Монастырские сады»). Not one of the ten designed fields. Spawn settings are shared with FIELD-001. Altars are fixed random points per run: cycling altars switch on for a short window of a long cycle (so the player runs between them), charging altars grow their bonus the longer the player stands inside, shrines fire a reward once after a fill and then rest for a long cooldown, strike altars drop warning circles and hit what stands in them. Every altar carries an explicit polarity (Positive, Negative, Neutral). Obstacles: five small ruins illustrations.",
